<title>USA: HA-LO to test catalog at Mail Boxes.</title>
<headline>HA-LO to test catalog at Mail Boxes.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ha-Lo Industries Inc, distributor of speciality advertising products, said Thursday it has an agreement to test its merchandise catalog at about 30 franchised Mail Boxes Etc centers in California.</p>
<p>Under the deal, the Mail Boxes centers will distribute HA-LO catalogs and display a sampling of some of the 600 products offered in the catalog, Ha-Lo said.</p>
</text>
